    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) as Amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, was given by me that. The Government intends to acquire the following land for a public purpose:",
