    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      495.17,
      286.45,
      594.32
    ],
    "text": "The Lot No.01 of the land called Thalahena in total extend of Hectare 0.0379 depicted in the preliminary plan No. Maha/6729 and dated on 23rd August 2017, prepared by the Surveyor General situated at Dippitiya Village of Dippitiya Grama Niladhari Division at Udagampaha Korale Minor Division in the Akurana Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kandy District in the Central Province.",
