    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are required to appear, before me personally, or by agent duly authorized in writing, at the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office Akuran on the 21st day of December 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 21st day of January 2018 the nature of their interests in the land, and the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the afore said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
